WEBVTT

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:18.850
<i>We are about to begin the second game</i>
<i>of the second round.</i>

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:23.440
In expectation of Raian's terrific fight,
the venue is filled with excitement!

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.440
SAYAKA KATAHARA
METSUDO KATAHARA'S DAUGHTER

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.060
Raian is a crazy fighter.

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:29.900
JERRY TYSON, REP. FIGHTER
OF 22ND CENTURY FAX (ELIMINATED)

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.280
Let's see how much Ohma's dubious
Niko Style can compete with him.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:39.580
Okay, the game will start shortly!

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.290
Which fighter is stronger?

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.090
KAZUO YAMASHITA
PRESIDENT OF YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:54.090
<i>Mr. Yamashita,</i>
<i>would you care to play a game with me?</i>

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.180
<i>The prize is your eldest son,</i>

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.760
<i>Kenzo Yamashita's life.</i>

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:03.850
Kazuo Yamashita.

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:06.140
Ohma.

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:08.230
OHMA TOKITA
FIGHTER - YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.570
I'll get going now.

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:12.480
Don't worry.

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.070
I won't get your son killed.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:17.610
Ohma.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:22.330
Just relax and watch.
I'll beat the crap out of that brat.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.630
What Raian Kure said is true.

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:35.550
I'm... upset with myself.

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:40.640
It's my fault Kenzo turned out this way.

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:45.680
<i>He was such a clever boy.</i>

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:48.350
SOMEI ELEMENTARY SCHOOL
JUNIOR HIGH THIRD-YEAR ENGLISH

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:51.270
<i>Since childhood,</i>
<i>he read many books and articles</i>

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.940
<i>that were too difficult for me.</i>

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:59.200
<i>He wasn't very good at sports,</i>

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:01.910
<i>but he was kind enough</i>
<i>to play catch with me.</i>

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.790
<i>I was so proud of him as my son.</i>

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:09.880
<i>But...</i>

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:17.340
<i>Kenzo?</i>

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:22.140
<i>What on earth are you doing?</i>

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:25.140
<i>It's a brain.</i>

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:34.110
<i>I made a human brain</i>
<i>using the nerve cells of rat.</i>

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:38.070
<i>Though it's still incomplete,</i>

00:02:38.490 --> 00:02:41.700
<i>I think it could be useful to my research.</i>

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:48.540
<i>Humans need evolution, Dad.</i>

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.790
<i>Inside Kenzo...</i>

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:57.210
<i>I saw a monster.</i>

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:03.430
<i>Not long after that...</i>

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:08.770
<i>Kenzo stopped appearing</i>
<i>in front of our family...</i>

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:13.690
<i>but I could do nothing for him.</i>

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:17.190
<i>No...</i>

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.570
<i>I just did nothing for him.</i>

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:24.030
<i>I was fearful of facing Kenzo...</i>

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:28.750
<i>and finding out how he had changed.</i>

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:35.210
<i>After that, my wife left us.</i>

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:39.260
<i>I was left alone in our home.</i>

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.800
I know it!

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:48.600
I'm the one who caused all the tragedy.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.980
If I had taken a firm attitude...

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.060
we would still be a happy family.

00:03:56.820 --> 00:04:00.860
I'm a failure as a father!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.490
But I'm still...

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.580
Kenzo's father!

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.620
It's impossible for me to abandon him.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.250
Ohma, please!

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.630
Take him down!

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:57.940
THE DEVIL

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.320
KENGAN LIFE-OR-DEATH

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:06.400
KENGAN MATCH

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:12.120
<i>Let's welcome the fighters</i>
<i>of the second round's second game!</i>

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:13.620
GAME TWO

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:18.250
<i>He perfectly destroyed Mokichi Robinson.</i>

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:21.330
<i>You'd call him a stone-cold</i>
<i>and cruel machine!</i>

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.210
This man has no mercy!

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:27.630
His only desire is to attack brutally.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:33.640
<i>Will he sink Ganryu Island</i>
<i>into a sea of blood?</i>

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:38.020
<i>Standing at 188 cm and weighing 94 kg,</i>

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:41.440
<i>his kengan match record is</i>
<i>one win and no losses.</i>

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:44.110
Representing Under Mount Incorporated,

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.780
<i>also known as the Taboo Descendant,</i>

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:51.030
<i>Raian Kure!</i>

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:01.250
RAIAN KURE, REPRESENTATIVE FIGHTER
OF UNDER MOUNT, INC.

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:05.500
VERSUS

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:12.340
Birthplace, unknown. Background, unknown.
His Niko Style is mysterious to all of us.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:15.260
<i>This year, he suddenly showed up</i>
<i>in kengan matches</i>

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.970
<i>to defy all the odds we predicted.</i>

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:22.560
What do you crave? For what do you fight?

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:27.440
<i>What hopes does this beast set</i>
<i>on his fists?</i>

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:31.360
<i>Standing at 182 cm and weighing 85 kg,</i>

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:34.660
<i>his kengan match record is</i>
<i>three wins and no losses.</i>

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:40.910
Total assets he acquired are
154 billion 230 million yen.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:46.340
Representing Yamashita Corporation,
also known as the Ashura,

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:51.930
<i>Ohma Tokita!</i>

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:05.360
Yo, underling.

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:08.820
Are you prepared to get
the shit beaten out of you?

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:13.150
You're such a fat-mouthed brat.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:19.120
<i>Don't hold back, Raian.</i>

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:24.540
<i>Ohma Tokita, I'll have you pay</i>
<i>for leading Karura on. Die here.</i>

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:26.670
ERIO KURE,
PATRIARCH OF KURE FAMILY

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:37.300
KARURA KURE
KURE FAMILY

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:39.680
<i>Ohma... Raian's strong.</i>

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:42.640
That Raian's got a cocky ass look
on his face.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:45.520
KEIZABURO SAWAD (ELIMINATED) -
LIHITO- FIGHTER & SH PRESIDENT

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:46.520
I don't like him.

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.980
HAJIME HANAFUSA
(ELIMINATED IN THE 1ST ROUND)

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:53.070
I wonder if he'll be okay.

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:57.030
Huh? Are you saying
Tokita is going to lose?

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.280
It's not about who wins or loses.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.790
I just hope he won't be defeated
by himself.

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:15.970
What's that crowd for?

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:17.680
KENZO YAMASHITA
KAZUO'S ELDEST SON

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:20.310
<i>Please evacuate according to instructions.</i>

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:24.770
FATHER

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:36.650
Perfect.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.660
They're panicked.

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.330
Capture the target now!

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.580
HENZO KURE
KURE FAMILY

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.540
FUSUI KURE
RAIAN'S YOUNGER SISTER

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:46.960
No one is wounded. It was right
to reduce the explosive quantity.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:49.170
Huh?

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:52.500
Wh-- What's that?

00:09:57.840 --> 00:09:59.180
The Kure Family...

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:04.100
Did being controlled by me
finally get on their nerves?

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:07.810
FATHER

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:17.780
<i>Are you both ready?</i>

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:26.500
Take your stance!

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:39.340
Fight!

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:52.110
<i>What's this?</i>

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:56.320
<i>Can a mere human emanate</i>
<i>such a murderous aura?</i>

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:59.150
I don't care...

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:02.780
who'll live or die.

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:05.030
I'll destroy everyone.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.790
Including you, underling!

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:10.290
IRONBREAKER

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.130
IRONBREAKER

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:16.630
SWIMMING SWALLOW

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.800
He's attacking from all angles!

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:20.550
NAOYA OHKUBO
RYO HIMURO

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.390
-He's even faster than before.
-He's trying to end it soon.

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:26.850
<i>Whoa! A storm of brutal blows!</i>

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:32.350
It's very hard to predict his punches
because the trajectories are random.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:37.900
What happened to you, jerk?
Is your energy coming out of desperation?

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:46.280
REDIRECTION KATA
WEEPING WILLOW

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:49.830
<i>He's strong!</i>

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:54.330
IRONBREAKER

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:56.500
FLAME FORM: PHANTOM PACE
IRONBREAKER

00:11:56.710 --> 00:12:00.340
<i>He's obviously gotten stronger</i>
<i>than his first game!</i>

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:03.130
FLASHING STEEL
SMASH

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:10.100
Oh, boy...
He's being beaten completely!

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:11.890
MASAHIKO OHTA
PRESIDENT UNDER MOUNT

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:12.850
Idiot.

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:22.360
Don't be upset just because
a silly kid has become a hostage.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:25.780
That doesn't matter to us, right?

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:28.620
Stand up right now, shit-bag.

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:34.120
I'll show you there's an insuperable line
you can't cross.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:36.500
<i>That's unbelievable!</i>

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:40.670
<i>Raian has almost no damage</i>
<i>after receiving those heavy attacks.</i>

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:44.630
<i>What kind of trick did he use?</i>

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:47.470
Do you see, Your Royal Highness Rama?

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:49.470
METSUDO KATAHARA
KENGAN ASSOCIATION

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:50.890
That's the Kure Family.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:52.850
RAMA XIII
RULER OF THE KINGDOM OF THAILAND

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.100
How bizarre.

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:57.190
However resistant to heavy blows
the fighter's body is,

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:01.990
how can he be so nonchalant
taking the full brunt of the onslaught?

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:04.950
The answer is in our blood.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.780
<i>Having done selective breeding</i>
<i>for 1300 years,</i>

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:14.960
<i>each one of their physical abilities</i>
<i>has surpassed those of present humanity.</i>

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:22.380
<i>With the body's endurance and the abnormal</i>
<i>secretion of 20 intracerebral narcotics...</i>

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:25.760
<i>outrageous damage can be endured.</i>

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:29.220
<i>Fighters who have resistant bodies...</i>

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:32.640
<i>have acquired them after birth.</i>

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:38.860
<i>But the Kure Family is born with endurance</i>
<i>that exceeds that of normal human.</i>

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:45.320
You could call the Kure Family
a new human race dedicated to combat.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:46.860
I see.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.820
<i>He is nothing less than a living weapon.</i>

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.040
You disappointed?

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:58.750
Your techniques are just crap.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.960
It only worked against the balls, though.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.840
I don't need impromptu tricks anymore.

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:09.970
I want to see the other version of you
that you showed in the first round.

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:15.520
Transform into it right now,
or I'll quickly kill you.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:19.310
Don't flatter yourself, kid.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:21.150
ADAMANTINE & FLAME KATA

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:26.070
Hey, are you deaf?

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:31.240
I said it wouldn't work.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:34.080
You're not aware, huh?

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:38.500
You haven't mastered the techniques yet.
That's why they're less accurate.

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.840
KAEDE AKIYAMA -
ADAMANTINE KATA

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:49.840
Don't run away.

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:00.440
No, Ohma!

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:05.940
AGITO KANOH
DAINIPPON BANK

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:07.940
Did you notice, Ohma Tokita?

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:12.530
<i>Raian Kure hasn't used</i>
<i>any of Kure's techniques at all yet.</i>

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:19.160
<i>You're overwhelmed, even by the force</i>
<i>of his physical abilities.</i>

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:24.840
<i>As things stand, he won't even need</i>
<i>to use his full power.</i>

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:29.510
See? This is how different our powers are.

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.840
Transform now, or I'll really kill you.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:37.970
I said you can't, stupid.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:39.730
Ohma!

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:44.610
<i>It doesn't work.</i>

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:49.240
<i>Niko, your style doesn't work.</i>

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:53.820
<i>I have no other choice</i>
<i>but to use the Advance to beat this jerk!</i>

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.280
<i>Ohma, please!</i>

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:58.580
<i>Take him down!</i>

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:07.170
<i>I would gladly give my life</i>
<i>to pull off a victory!</i>

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.720
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:18.510
<i>Oh, that's right!</i>

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.930
<i>Ohma has this trick!</i>

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.570
Finally, you did it!

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:34.450
You should've started out that way!

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:41.450
<i>That's fast! His move doubled in speed</i>
<i>compared to that of the first round.</i>

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.760
Is that all?

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:52.840
Come at me like hell!

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:00.560
What's that?

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:04.270
Have you gotten slower?

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.980
<i>He's gotten even faster!</i>

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:14.700
SETSUNA KIRYU
KOUOU EDUCATION GROUP

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:16.380
This is what I've been waiting for!

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:19.660
<i>It took ten years to release you</i>
<i>from the curse.</i>

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:23.870
<i>It was really, really long for me.</i>

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.250
<i>That day, I saw...</i>

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:31.710
<i>a god inside you.</i>

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:38.090
What a furious fist fight!
Give it more!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:54.610
<i>Okay, then.</i>

00:17:56.400 --> 00:18:00.240
<i>You can still continue,</i>
<i>even if I use this, right?</i>

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:04.660
That idiot is doing it again
in spite of me!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.870
Here it comes!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:12.960
KURE FAMILY'S SECRET TECHNIQUE: REMOVAL

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:16.970
Who cares?

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:21.140
Whoever you are, I'll just kill you!

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:24.600
<i>Ohma's eyes...</i>

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.940
<i>He looks quite similar to the Kure's!</i>

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:32.150
You've quit being human, right?

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:34.650
But you're still not at my level.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:36.650
Just shut up and die!

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:45.040
<i>Ohma's gotten stronger.</i>

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:49.960
<i>But if you continue fighting</i>
<i>in that way, your body will...</i>

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.170
Did you notice it, too?

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:55.130
Dr. Hanafusa.

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:58.050
The truth of his mysterious power...

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:01.090
seems to be just as I thought.

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:04.260
The source of Ohma's energy is...

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.310
his heart.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.980
His heart?

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:14.190
<i>The heart is an organ</i>
<i>that acts like an engine for animals.</i>

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:19.070
It seems Ohma can accelerate
the heart rate intentionally.

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:24.370
Then, it astronomically raises
the speed of blood circulation,

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:28.500
producing an amount of heat that is
then converted into athletic ability.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.580
That's the mechanism of the Advance.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:37.130
It differs from the Kures' Removal that is
done by unleashing potential abilities.

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:39.880
Interesting, indeed.

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:42.720
He's too reckless.

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:47.600
Doesn't it have a bad impact on his body?

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:50.600
Of course, it does.

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:53.190
<i>It'll begin with vascular damage.</i>

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:58.030
<i>Then a brain hemorrhage will cause</i>
<i>a loss or scrambling of memory,</i>

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:00.570
<i>visual and auditory hallucinations...</i>

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:04.490
<i>In the end,</i>
<i>his heart will reach its limit.</i>

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:07.830
Limit? You mean...

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:12.670
Though it's just my presumption
based on his heart sounds I detected,

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:17.550
Ohma is exhausting his body
four or five times that of usual.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:20.920
Considering also the physical damages,

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:25.050
his life's now in an extremely
precarious situation.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:27.970
<i>O... Ohma's going...</i>

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:29.600
<i>to die?</i>

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.270
Cheap shots, shithead!

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:39.400
Use Kure's techniques, idiot!

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:41.190
REICHI, HORIO, HOLLIS
KURE FAMILY

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.400
He’s enjoying the fight,

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:47.200
leaving aside his biggest desire
for one-sided onslaught.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:49.540
I've never seen this before.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:54.170
<i>If I use Kure's techniques,</i>
<i>the game will finish in a second.</i>

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:58.960
<i>Give me more! You can still fight, right?</i>

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:03.760
Make it more fucking exciting!

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:05.720
Don't say that's all you got!

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:14.690
<i>Mr. Yamashita,</i>
<i>you have to make a decision...</i>

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:17.690
<i>whether to continue the match.</i>

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:19.610
Or...

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:22.490
Huh? Mr. Yamashita?

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:28.910
<i>Damn it! Answer the phone!</i>

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:33.290
<i>If Kenzo successfully escapes,</i>
<i>I can make Ohma throw the game!</i>

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:36.460
<i>Answer the phone, Kenzo!</i>

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:38.580
<i>Please...</i>

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:40.750
<i>Please stay safe!</i>

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.510
<i>I can see it.</i>

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:50.720
<i>I can see how he'll move.</i>

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:54.810
Go to hell!

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:59.900
It was really fun, Ohma Tokita.

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:03.230
I've enjoyed it enough.

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:06.110
It's time for you to die.

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:08.660
<i>What?</i>

00:22:09.280 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>My body feels heavy.</i>

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:14.870
<i>Don't fuck around.</i>

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:17.870
<i>I can still...</i>

00:22:19.630 --> 00:22:24.000
<i>"Taboo Descendant" is the nickname</i>
<i>for the whole Kure Family.</i>

00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:28.180
<i>The true nickname for Raian Kure is Devil.</i>

00:22:29.220 --> 00:22:31.800
<i>The Devil destroys everything.</i>

00:22:43.020 --> 00:22:44.480
KENZO

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:49.700
O... Ohma...

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:06.860
PREVIEW

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:10.940
<i>Dying! Dying! He can't be okay!</i>
<i>Put forth your final effort!</i>

00:24:11.010 --> 00:24:13.990
<i>Destroy his life!</i>
<i>Place your hopes in your fists!</i>

00:24:14.370 --> 00:24:16.200
<i>This is the ultimate phase for human!</i>

00:24:16.490 --> 00:24:18.330
<i>This is Kengan Ashura!</i>

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:19.620
<i>Next episode: "Father."</i>

00:24:20.160 --> 00:24:21.870
Subtitle translation by Hinako Someno
